<h3>Why not the others</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>(a)</b> Swaps Kshemavathy and Sivaraman, and Viswanathan and Madhabi Devi; wrong.</li>
<li><b>(c)</b> Swaps Kshemavathy and Sivaraman; wrong.</li>
