addNote("ir", "Security cooperation: INTERPOL", `
<p>Notices: <b>Red</b> (arrest for extradition), Yellow (missing), <b>Blue</b> (additional information), <b>Black</b> (unidentified bodies), <b>Green</b> (warning, threat to public safety), Orange (imminent threat), Purple (modus operandi), <b>Silver</b> (criminal assets, 2025). HQ Lyon. India's NCB: CBI (Bharatpol portal, 2025).</p>`);

