<li><b>Krishnadevaraya</b> (1509–29): allowed the Portuguese a fort at <b>Bhatkal</b> (horse trade, anti-Bijapur alliance). <i>Amuktamalyada</i>. Ashtadiggajas. Raichur (1520).</li>
